        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a leading provider of Medicare compliance services in the industry, we play a critical role in assisting and protecting all stakeholders, including Medicare and its beneficiaries.",
        "start_character": 31468,
        "end_character": 31650
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As such an advisory organization, we provide statistical, actuarial, policy language development, and related solutions and services to P&C insurers, including advisory prospective loss costs, other prospective cost information, manual rules, and policy language.",
        "start_character": 59266,
        "end_character": 59529
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Lastly, in 2025, we significantly expanded leadership development through our enterprise coaching offering, partnering with a global roster of International Coaching Federation-certified coaches.",
        "start_character": 54082,
        "end_character": 54277
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the past five decades, we have developed core expertise in acquiring, processing, managing, protecting, and operating large and comprehensive databases that are the foundation of our insurance offerings.",
        "start_character": 11777,
        "end_character": 11985
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "They are used for the storage, processing, access, and delivery of the data that forms the foundation of our business and the development and delivery of the solutions we provide to our customers.",
        "start_character": 45177,
        "end_character": 45373
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Using our large database of premium and loss data, we provide actuarial services to help our clients analyze and price their risks.",
        "start_character": 12877,
        "end_character": 13008
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also compete with a variety of organizations that offer consulting services, primarily specialty technology and consulting firms.",
        "start_character": 35930,
        "end_character": 36062
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer services to evaluate the effectiveness of community enforcement of building codes and the efforts of communities to mitigate damage from flooding.",
        "start_character": 17787,
        "end_character": 17947
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to a framework for business continuity management and carry out annual reviews of the state of preparedness of each business unit.",
        "start_character": 45960,
        "end_character": 46107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on understanding and documenting business unit and corporate data assets and data issues, sharing and combining data assets across the enterprise, creating an enterprise data strategy, facilitating research and product development, and promoting cross-enterprise communication.",
        "start_character": 37555,
        "end_character": 37847
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our P&C insurance industry expertise, and our ability to offer multiple applications, services, and integrated solutions to individual customers are competitive strengths.",
        "start_character": 36858,
        "end_character": 37045
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-004452",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-004452-cdd451e28ca7d224",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-004452",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the protection of our proprietary technology is important to our success, and we will continue to seek to protect those intellectual property assets for which we have expended substantial research and development capital and that are material to our business.",
